{"seq":3,"slug":"crdt-mobile-applications","title":"CRDT 在移动端的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/crdt-mobile-applications","wordCount":1754,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"crdt-在移动端的应用\">CRDT 在移动端的应用</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CRDT（Conflict-free Replicated Data Types）是数学上保证多副本自动收敛的数据结构。核心概念包括：状态式 vs 操作式 CRDT 分类、移动端高频类型（PN-Counter / OR-Set / LWW-Register / RGA）、墓碑问题与 GC 策略、引擎选型（Yjs / Automerge 3 / Loro）、内存与存储优化（列式压缩 / 增量同步 / 延迟加载），以及与平台同步层的集成桥接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从学术概念到移动端工程实践\">从学术概念到移动端工程实践</h2><p>Conflict-free Replicated Data Types（CRDT）是一类数据结构，其数学特性保证多个副本可以独立修改并最终自动收敛到一致状态，无需协调服务器。2019 年 Ink &amp; Switch 提出 Local-First Software 愿景时，CRDT 还是学术界的研究课题。到 2026 年，Yjs、Automerge 3、Loro 1.0 等库已在 Linear、Figma、Notion 等百万级用户产品中验证了生产可行性。</p>\n<p>移动端采用 CRDT 面临的独特挑战：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内存约束</strong>：CRDT 元数据（墓碑、向量时钟、操作历史）随时间增长，移动设备内存有限</li>\n<li><strong>存储增长</strong>：删除操作不能真正释放空间（墓碑标记），数据库持续膨胀</li>\n<li><strong>带宽效率</strong>：状态式 CRDT 全量同步在蜂窝网络下成本过高</li>\n<li><strong>电量敏感</strong>：CRDT 合并操作的 CPU 计算影响电池寿命</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"crdt-家族分类与移动端适用性\">CRDT 家族分类与移动端适用性</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CRDT 类型</th>\n<th>数据结构</th>\n<th>收敛保证</th>\n<th>移动端适用度</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>G-Counter</td>\n<td>只增计数器</td>\n<td>各节点本地计数累加</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>阅读次数、步数统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PN-Counter</td>\n<td>可增可减计数器</td>\n<td>正负计数器组合</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>购物车数量、点赞数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LWW-Register</td>\n<td>单值寄存器</td>\n<td>最后写入时间戳胜出</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>用户设置、状态标记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MV-Register</td>\n<td>多值寄存器</td>\n<td>保留所有并发版本</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>需要用户选择的冲突场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OR-Set</td>\n<td>可增删集合</td>\n<td>添加优先于并发删除</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>标签、成员列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RGA</td>\n<td>有序序列</td>\n<td>唯一 ID 排序</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>聊天消息列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Yjs YATA</td>\n<td>文本/富文本</td>\n<td>操作式 RGA 变体</td>\n<td>低-中</td>\n<td>协作文本编辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Automerge JSON</td>\n<td>嵌套 JSON 文档</td>\n<td>列式存储 + 操作合并</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>结构化协作文档</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"移动端高频场景-计数器与集合\">移动端高频场景：计数器与集合</h2><h3 id=\"pn-counter-离线计数的正确实现\">PN-Counter：离线计数的正确实现</h3><p>传统的 <code>count += 1</code> 在并发场景下不安全——两台设备各自 +1 后同步，LWW 会丢失一次增量。PN-Counter 通过为每个节点维护独立的增减计数解决此问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Value</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>nodes</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>nodes</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Value}(c) = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{nodes}} P_i - \\sum_{i \\in \\text{nodes}} N_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Value</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">nodes</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">nodes</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的正计数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的负计数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// iOS 实现示例：基于设备 ID 的 PN-Counter&#10;struct PNCounter: Codable {&#10;    var increments: [String: Int]  // deviceId → 累计增量&#10;    var decrements: [String: Int]  // deviceId → 累计减量&#10;&#10;    var value: Int {&#10;        increments.values.reduce(0, +) - decrements.values.reduce(0, +)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    mutating func increment(by amount: Int = 1, device: String) {&#10;        increments[device, default: 0] += amount&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    mutating func decrement(by amount: Int = 1, device: String) {&#10;        decrements[device, default: 0] += amount&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func merge(with other: PNCounter) -&gt; PNCounter {&#10;        var result = PNCounter(increments: [:], decrements: [:])&#10;        for (device, count) in increments {&#10;            result.increments[device] = max(count, other.increments[device] ?? 0)&#10;        }&#10;        for (device, count) in other.increments where result.increments[device] == nil {&#10;            result.increments[device] = count&#10;        }&#10;        for (device, count) in decrements {&#10;            result.decrements[device] = max(count, other.decrements[device] ?? 0)&#10;        }&#10;        for (device, count) in other.decrements where result.decrements[device] == nil {&#10;            result.decrements[device] = count&#10;        }&#10;        return result&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// iOS 实现示例：基于设备 ID 的 PN-Counter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PNCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Codable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> increments: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// deviceId → 累计增量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decrements: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// deviceId → 累计减量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        increments.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decrements.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    mutating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">device</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        increments[device, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    mutating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> decrement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">device</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        decrements[device, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> other: PNCounter) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PNCounter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PNCounter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">increments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decrements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (device, count) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> increments {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result.increments[device] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count, other.increments[device] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (device, count) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> other.increments </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.increments[device] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result.increments[device] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (device, count) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decrements {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result.decrements[device] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count, other.decrements[device] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (device, count) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> other.decrements </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.decrements[device] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result.decrements[device] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"or-set-标签管理的并发安全方案\">OR-Set：标签管理的并发安全方案</h3><p>OR-Set（Observed-Remove Set）解决集合操作中的经典问题：设备 A 添加元素、设备 B 同时删除该元素时如何决策。OR-Set 的语义是<strong>添加优先</strong>——只有「观察到」某个特定的添加操作后才能删除它。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;设备 A&quot;&#10;        A1[&quot;add(&#39;urgent&#39;, tag_id_1)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;设备 B&quot;&#10;        B1[&quot;remove(&#39;urgent&#39;, tag_id_1)&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;add(&#39;urgent&#39;, tag_id_2)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;合并结果&quot;&#10;        R[&quot;集合 = {&#39;urgent&#39;}&lt;br/&gt;因为 tag_id_2 未被 remove 观察到&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A1 --&gt; R&#10;    B1 --&gt; R&#10;    B2 --&gt; R\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"设备 A\"\n        A1[\"add('urgent', tag_id_1)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"设备 B\"\n        B1[\"remove('urgent', tag_id_1)\"]\n        B2[\"add('urgent', tag_id_2)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"合并结果\"\n        R[\"集合 = {'urgent'}&lt;br/&gt;因为 tag_id_2 未被 remove 观察到\"]\n    end\n    A1 --&gt; R\n    B1 --&gt; R\n    B2 --&gt; R</pre><h2 id=\"移动端-crdt-引擎选型-2026\">移动端 CRDT 引擎选型（2026）</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>引擎</th>\n<th>语言/运行时</th>\n<th>移动端支持</th>\n<th>文档大小效率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Yjs</td>\n<td>JS/WASM</td>\n<td>React Native ✓, Flutter ✗</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>富文本协作编辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Automerge 3</td>\n<td>Rust+WASM/JS</td>\n<td>React Native ✓, Swift ✓</td>\n<td>高（列式压缩 10x）</td>\n<td>结构化 JSON 文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loro 1.0</td>\n<td>Rust+WASM</td>\n<td>React Native ✓, 原生绑定 WIP</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>可移动树 + 富文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自建轻量 CRDT</td>\n<td>原生语言</td>\n<td>完全控制</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>计数器/集合/简单寄存器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Automerge 3 的列式存储</strong>是 2026 年的重要进展——它将操作历史压缩为列式二进制格式，文档体积相比 Automerge 1/2 缩小约 10 倍，这对移动端的存储和传输约束意义重大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"墓碑问题与-gc-策略\">墓碑问题与 GC 策略</h2><p>CRDT 的一个工程痛点是<strong>删除不释放空间</strong>。为了让后续合并时仍能正确处理「这个元素已被删除」的语义，删除操作通常以墓碑（Tombstone）标记而非物理删除实现。</p>\n<p>在移动端，墓碑无限积累会导致：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据库体积持续增长</li>\n<li>查询性能下降（需要过滤大量已删除记录）</li>\n<li>同步时传输无用数据</li>\n</ul>\n<p>GC 策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[检测墓碑记录] --&gt; B{所有副本已确认收到?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[安全物理删除]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[保留墓碑]&#10;    C --&gt; E[更新 GC watermark]&#10;    D --&gt; F[等待确认或超过 TTL]&#10;    F --&gt; G{TTL 过期?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[物理删除 + 标记为需要全量重同步]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| D\">flowchart TD\n    A[检测墓碑记录] --&gt; B{所有副本已确认收到?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[安全物理删除]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[保留墓碑]\n    C --&gt; E[更新 GC watermark]\n    D --&gt; F[等待确认或超过 TTL]\n    F --&gt; G{TTL 过期?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[物理删除 + 标记为需要全量重同步]\n    G --&gt;|否| D</pre><p>实践方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>确认式 GC</strong>：所有客户端确认收到删除操作后，服务端广播 GC 指令，各客户端物理删除。安全但需要追踪所有客户端状态</li>\n<li><strong>TTL-based GC</strong>：墓碑存在超过阈值（如 30 天）后物理删除。简单但有边界情况——超过 30 天未同步的设备重新上线时需全量重同步</li>\n<li><strong>Epoch-based GC</strong>：服务端定期生成全量快照（epoch），客户端可从最近的 epoch 重新初始化而非从头回放操作历史</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"移动端-crdt-的内存与存储优化\">移动端 CRDT 的内存与存储优化</h2><h3 id=\"操作压缩\">操作压缩</h3><p>长时间编辑会产生大量操作（如文本编辑中每个字符一个操作）。Automerge 3 的列式压缩和 Yjs 的 <code>encodeStateAsUpdate</code> 都实现了操作合并——多个连续操作压缩为一个「批量操作」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"增量同步\">增量同步</h3><p>状态式 CRDT 全量同步在移动端不可行。所有成熟引擎都支持增量同步：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SyncPayload</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>encode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>State</mtext><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>State</mtext><mtext>remote</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SyncPayload} = \\text{encode}(\\text{State}_{\\text{local}} - \\text{State}_{\\text{remote}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SyncPayload</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">encode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">State</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">State</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remote</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Yjs 通过 <code>Y.encodeStateVector()</code> + <code>Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(doc, remoteStateVector)</code> 实现精确的增量编码——只传输对方缺少的操作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"延迟加载\">延迟加载</h3><p>移动端不必将完整 CRDT 文档加载到内存。可以按需加载子树或分页加载操作历史。Automerge 的 <code>Automerge.load(doc, { patchCallback })</code> 支持延迟解码——只有被访问的部分才真正解码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与平台同步层的集成\">与平台同步层的集成</h2><p>CRDT 库本身不处理网络传输——它只负责数据结构的合并逻辑。在移动端需要将 CRDT 与平台同步层桥接：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>同步层</th>\n<th>CRDT 集成方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>iOS</td>\n<td>CloudKit / CKSyncEngine</td>\n<td>将 CRDT 文档序列化为 CKRecord 的 bytes 字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Android</td>\n<td>WorkManager + 自建同步</td>\n<td>CRDT 二进制存入 Room BLOB 列，WorkManager 调度上传</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td>PowerSync / ElectricSQL</td>\n<td>CRDT 列存为 JSONB/BLOB，sync rule 按文档同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键设计决策：CRDT 操作的粒度是否与同步层的粒度对齐。若 CRDT 文档粒度大于同步层行粒度，每次字符编辑都会触发整行同步——浪费带宽。解决方案是将 CRDT 操作日志作为独立的同步流，与业务数据的 CRUD 同步分开通道传输。</p>\n<p>具体的 iOS 和 Android 集成实现分别参见 <a href=\"../implementation/ios-core-data-cloudkit\">iOS Core Data 与 CloudKit 同步</a> 和 <a href=\"../implementation/android-room-workmanager\">Android Room 与 WorkManager</a>。而 <a href=\"conflict-resolution-strategies\">冲突解决策略</a> 中讨论的 LWW、字段级合并等简单策略，可视为 CRDT 的退化形式——LWW-Register 本身就是最简单的 CRDT。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>CRDT 为移动端离线同步提供了数学层面的收敛保证——无需协调服务器即可实现多副本一致。移动端的独特约束（内存、存储、带宽、电量）要求选型时权衡 CRDT 元数据开销：简单场景用 PN-Counter/OR-Set 即可，协作编辑才需要 Yjs/Automerge。2026 年 Automerge 3 的列式压缩和 Loro 的 Rust 性能让 CRDT 在移动端的工程可行性大幅提升。墓碑 GC 仍是需要长期关注的运维问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CRDT 在移动端的应用","id":"crdt-在移动端的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从学术概念到移动端工程实践","id":"从学术概念到移动端工程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"CRDT 家族分类与移动端适用性","id":"crdt-家族分类与移动端适用性"},{"level":2,"text":"移动端高频场景：计数器与集合","id":"移动端高频场景-计数器与集合"},{"level":3,"text":"PN-Counter：离线计数的正确实现","id":"pn-counter-离线计数的正确实现"},{"level":3,"text":"OR-Set：标签管理的并发安全方案","id":"or-set-标签管理的并发安全方案"},{"level":2,"text":"移动端 CRDT 引擎选型（2026）","id":"移动端-crdt-引擎选型-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"墓碑问题与 GC 策略","id":"墓碑问题与-gc-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"移动端 CRDT 的内存与存储优化","id":"移动端-crdt-的内存与存储优化"},{"level":3,"text":"操作压缩","id":"操作压缩"},{"level":3,"text":"增量同步","id":"增量同步"},{"level":3,"text":"延迟加载","id":"延迟加载"},{"level":2,"text":"与平台同步层的集成","id":"与平台同步层的集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"冲突解决策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/sync-engines/conflict-resolution-strategies"},"next":{"title":"iOS Core Data 与 CloudKit 同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-offline-sync/implementation/ios-core-data-cloudkit"}}